# S16/EP64 HTSim topology corresponding to the 128-GPU FlowSim/ns-3 setup.
# Hosts 0..127 are GPU/rank endpoints: 64 prefill and 64 decode ranks.
# Four 32-port leaves feed two spines through 16 parallel links per
# leaf-spine pair.  The bundle is a topology representation detail; each
# endpoint remains attached at 200 Gbps and the aggregate leaf-spine
# directional capacity is 16 * 200 Gbps.
Nodes 128
Tiers 2
Podsize 128

Tier 0
Downlink_speed_Gbps 200
Radix_Down 32
Radix_Up 32
Downlink_Latency_ns 5000
Switch_Latency_ns 0
Oversubscribed 1
Queue_Up 1048576
Queue_Down 1048576

Tier 1
Downlink_speed_Gbps 200
Radix_Down 64
Downlink_Latency_ns 5000
Switch_Latency_ns 0
Bundle 16
Queue_Down 1048576
